<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-LEVSKI SOFIA 1 SLOVAN BRATISLAVA 1-RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEVSKI SOFIA 1 SLOVAN BRATISLAVA 1-RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Levski Sofia of Bulgaria and Slovan Bratislava from Slovakia drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in their European Cup Winners' Cup qualifying round first leg match on Thursday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Levski Sofia - Georgi Ivanov 18</p>
<p>Slovan Bratislava - Robert Novak 65</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
